<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 324pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 27.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 306pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 25.5" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>29</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: 35.4pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.94" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>学年校级及以上各项先进推荐、评比方案<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: 35.4pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.94" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">一、指导思想</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">按照“师德为首，业绩突出，群众公认”的原则，把真正为学校教育、教学、管理、服务工作付出辛勤劳动、做出突出成绩和较大贡献的教工推荐出来，凝聚正能量，倡导新风尚，促进新发展。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">二、评比流程<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">按照“组内先推荐、处室再考核、学校后评定”的流程做好各项先进人选的推荐、考核与评定工作。各组须按评比条件规定的条款如实推荐，相关职能处室须依据“德、勤、能、绩</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">、廉”对推<SPAN style="COLOR: black">荐人选进行考核打分，学校综合各方面情况进行最终人选的调整与评定。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">三、评比条件<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 23.6pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（一）符合下列条件的教工在同等条件下优先推荐为先进候选人：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">满工作量或超工作量；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">教学业绩突出，所带班级学生在学校统一组织的大型考试中平均分提高率或优秀人数提高率位于同学科组前三分之一的教师；在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">学科竞赛辅导中有取得突出成绩或明显进步的辅导教师；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">在特长生培养中成绩突出的教师；（教学处负责考核）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">积极发扬奉献精神，主动代课或承担</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">监考、命题和高考阅卷等</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">教育教学工作和服从学校安排承担超工作量的教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">；（教学处负责考核）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">重视学科教学研究，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">积极承担选修课课程开发与实施任务；在优质课等教学业务比赛中获市属级一等奖及以上奖项的教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">；教研成果在学科正规刊物公开发表或在省市评比中获市级一等奖及以上</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">的教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（教科室负责考核）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">．教学满意度调查结果优良，受到学生、家长、同事的好评；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（教科室负责考核）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">师德优良，无家长教学质量等方面的事实投诉和有偿家教等有损师德师风的情况。（党政办负责考核）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
